                        <td class="py-3 px-5">{cell === null ? <span class="text-slate-300">—</span> : `${cell} ft`}</td>
                      ))}
                    </tr>
                  ))
                }
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>

          <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-slate-500">
            Sources &amp; standards: NEC (NFPA 70) 2023 — 210.19(A) and 215.2(A) Informational Notes on
